---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Tess It"
  description="tess-it is where Emir builds his own small, carefully made apps for Mac, mobile, and the web."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 pt-12">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="heading-rule mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
      Hi, I&rsquo;m Emir
    </h1>

    <div class="about-prose mt-8">
      <p>
        I&rsquo;m a developer from Ukraine. I&rsquo;ve spent over a decade building commercial
        software &mdash; seventeen projects across mobile, web, and desktop, mostly with Flutter.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>tess-it</strong> is where I build my own apps: small, useful tools that respect your
        time, privacy, and attention. Fast to open, quiet by default, and local-first wherever it
        makes sense &mdash; no accounts you didn&rsquo;t ask for, no data leaving your device.
      </p>
      <p>
        It isn&rsquo;t an agency, and I&rsquo;m not for hire. It&rsquo;s a studio of one, shipping a
        small, carefully made catalog of apps for Mac, mobile, and the web &mdash; the kind of tools
        I want to use myself.
      </p>
      <p>
        Have a question or an idea? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a> &mdash; I read everything.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .heading-rule {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }
  .heading-rule::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 4px;
    width: 64px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      var(--su-tangerine) 0 25%,
      var(--su-magenta) 25% 50%,
      var(--su-golden) 50% 75%,
      var(--su-teal) 75% 100%
    );
  }

  .about-prose p {
    margin-top: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--su-ink-muted);
  }
  .about-prose strong {
    color: var(--su-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .about-prose a {
    color: var(--su-accent-text);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    transition: text-decoration-color 0.2s;
  }
</style>
